OL,3,GNEWSAArsonist who crashed car in police
OL,4,Achase jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn arsonist who set fire to two cars -
OL,7,Fbefore leading police on a high-speed
OL,8,Fchase that ended when he crashed - has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FKrzysztof Orzechowski, 32, forced a
OL,12,Ffamily to flee their home in Slough,
OL,13,FBerkshire, when he set the vehicles
OL,14,Falight and the fire spread to their
OL,15,Fhouse on 9 March.
OL,17,FSix days later, he drove at speeds of
OL,18,Fup to 100mph on winding roads as he
OL,19,Ftried to evade officers before losing
OL,20,Fcontrol of the car on a corner. He was
OL,21,Funhurt and arrested.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
