OL,3,GNEWSAArsonist who crashed car in police
OL,4,Achase jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrzechowski, of no fixed address,
OL,7,Fadmitted arson with intent to endanger
OL,8,Flife and driving a motor vehicle
OL,9,Fdangerously and was jailed for five
OL,10,Fyears and seven months, with an
OL,11,Fextended period of three years, at
OL,12,FReading Crown Court last week.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
